2-V9hHYrj3KYE0U8Zm5CVBsk9lq3YbqkLvtXBC-a48ofGMXDgnQimRMy8JUTjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGneQAMwlMvs5m9fuGsvleIYlTE7dNaV41EFOj0Q1JXMA&oe=6A900A17"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BWlXSS9n_sMQ7kNvwEXqmca&_nc_oc=AdqqR9bd5W963qXh8-93GLxIIifl6SA_Ly-RuT5eYIb8FBTMQl4B1jzJ_6tBHqmlDf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFM2brU8jG7fjnVinDBpTvR6NLzKMdibAt9UzT17P3kZg&oe=6A900821"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e4m5BHfgGfgQ7kNvwGm_5V_&_nc_oc=Adrqgnq2kLN_UORF8ySA9TFJGEp-gVAbUATIRI3v-k3KyROnw2SjhabLH4vaAa5FwaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQExsc89uMsbiOlt0ObYTnd1nsSB3N64eP1AkcQy6oUrWA&oe=6A902E97"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nXqxLAzV-boQ7kNvwFhDYb7&_nc_oc=AdpcpD5T2TEqG7mFZHid1rp_A1S0W6j6xiKzEdHsNKVeyomwGROCj61MMuCcHmUHbQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGBP8s3cmZ_yu3y0SVCZHyl4ZhVLbkTHKk4igiiiD3GLA&oe=6A903522"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zFHJvPhLbQ8Q7kNvwFAX9I_&_nc_oc=AdpWM4nXOkSGN2ULlM0n05GnuPLdwn-SqiqOkQ4PPuKmTsqbCJ7iXnr2gQOnyRZr_oA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEspLFWUbJGM14qaI6BwCgRUnxNOjUuSx-yKA8Cu3cXcA&oe=6A90216E"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null